      "lineNbr": 51,
      "author": {
        "id": 4665459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-02T01:00:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`current` is meant for internal iteration state and `activeTask` for an external thread asking (via the toString) whats currently running. Using `activeTask` everywhere will make every read within the iteration volatile, which is not needed.",
      "parentUuid": "bb9d739d_b80eb2d6",
      "revId": "c71b776065d3d870163616755c6f1bb726bae0a7",
